<title>UK: Bangladesh tenders to buy cargo white sugar - trade.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh tenders to buy cargo white sugar - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh tendered to buy a 12,500-tonne cargo of white sugar with offers to be submitted on March 1, London traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The specified shipment period was March 11/April 11, they said.  </p>
<p>Last July, Bangladesh's state-owned Sugar and Food Industries Corporation bought 12,500 tonnes of white sugar at $371 per tonne c &amp; f for August shipment.</p>
<p>--Jeremy Smith, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
</text>
